{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-95","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","sourceIds":["event-rogue-95"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-95-talk-403816690-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-95","missionId":"event-rogue-95","mission":"수리공 (2)","scene":"수리공 (2)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"당신은 다시 한번 수리공의 공방으로 돌아온다. 당신이 올 걸 진작에 알았다는 듯, 그는 부속품을 탁자에 가지런히 늘어놓으며 흥겹게 노래를 흥얼거린다","talkId":403816690,"textHash":"12837885657968585795","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:95/talk-403816690","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"5f3e33a28e7d12f1","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-95-talk-403816691-line"],"bwikiPage":"修补匠（其二）","bwikiRevision":58940,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14334","bwikiMission":"수리공 (2)"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-95-talk-403816691-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-95","missionId":"event-rogue-95","mission":"수리공 (2)","scene":"수리공 (2)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「세상에 쓸모없는 건 없단다. 쓸모를 발견하지 못했을 뿐이지」","talkId":403816691,"textHash":"11082235843373050766","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:95/talk-403816691","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"5f3e33a28e7d12f1","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-95-talk-403816692-line"],"bwikiPage":"修补匠（其二）","bwikiRevision":58940,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14334","bwikiMission":"수리공 (2)"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-95-talk-403816692-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-95","missionId":"event-rogue-95","mission":"수리공 (2)","scene":"수리공 (2)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「군대 계급과 무기, 경비, 실험실… 쓸모 있다는 것들이 환락을 앗아간다면, 그게 무슨 소용이 있겠나? 난 오랜 시간이 지나고 나서야 이 이치를 깨달았지」","talkId":403816692,"textHash":"10647351700235214127","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:95/talk-403816692","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"5f3e33a28e7d12f1","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-95-talk-403816693-line"],"bwikiPage":"修补匠（其二）","bwikiRevision":58940,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14334","bwikiMission":"수리공 (2)"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-95-talk-403816693-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-95","missionId":"event-rogue-95","mission":"수리공 (2)","scene":"수리공 (2)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「네가 그때 남기고 간 폐품을 기억하니? 그걸로 새로운 장난감을 만들었단다. 너도 해볼래? 잘할 수 있을 거야」 노인은 기대에 찬 눈빛으로 부속품을 내민다","talkId":403816693,"textHash":"16421451690641514838","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:95/talk-403816693","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"5f3e33a28e7d12f1","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"修补匠（其二）","bwikiRevision":58940,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14334","bwikiMission":"수리공 (2)"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-95-text-9219460015476575958-choice","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-95","missionId":"event-rogue-95","mission":"수리공 (2)","scene":"수리공 (2)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"부속품을 조금 추가한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"9219460015476575958","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:95/text-9219460015476575958","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"470a3b53e3583640","bwikiNextIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-95-text-12251224386858267226-effect"],"bwikiPage":"修补匠（其二）","bwikiRevision":58940,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14334","bwikiMission":"수리공 (2)"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-95-text-12251224386858267226-effect","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-95","missionId":"event-rogue-95","mission":"수리공 (2)","scene":"수리공 (2)","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"폐품을 미소로 재탄생시킨다","talkId":null,"textHash":"12251224386858267226","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:95/text-12251224386858267226","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"470a3b53e3583640","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"修补匠（其二）","bwikiRevision":58940,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14334","bwikiMission":"수리공 (2)","bwikiReplyToIds":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-95-text-9219460015476575958-choice"]},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-95-text-813546818915907131-choice","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-95","missionId":"event-rogue-95","mission":"수리공 (2)","scene":"수리공 (2)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"영감을 조금 추가한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"813546818915907131","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:95/text-813546818915907131","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"1a2a761c9e0b8db6","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"修补匠（其二）","bwikiRevision":58940,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14334","bwikiMission":"수리공 (2)"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-95-text-9809433352486142502-choice","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-95","missionId":"event-rogue-95","mission":"수리공 (2)","scene":"수리공 (2)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"기쁨을 조금 부어 넣는다","talkId":null,"textHash":"9809433352486142502","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:95/text-9809433352486142502","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"e72c13f1147a6349","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"修补匠（其二）","bwikiRevision":58940,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14334","bwikiMission":"수리공 (2)"},{"id":"unknowable-domain-event-rogue-95-talk-403816694-line","entryId":"unknowable-domain","chapterId":"event-rogue-95","missionId":"event-rogue-95","mission":"수리공 (2)","scene":"수리공 (2)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"폐기된 부속품은 삐뚤빼뚤한 장난감으로 조립되어 있다. 입가에 억누를 수 없는 미소가 걸리는 게 느껴진다","talkId":403816694,"textHash":"5364474934423795667","source":"rogueHandBookEvent:95/talk-403816694","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"81df626a1af1706e","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"修补匠（其二）","bwikiRevision":58940,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-14334","bwikiMission":"수리공 (2)"}],"orderNote":"공식 사건 도감에 귀속된 한국어 원문입니다. BWIKI에서 확인한 모드별 구간만 연결하며 조건·확률·미확인 경계는 이어 붙이지 않습니다.","bwikiBaseOrder":["unknowable-domain-event-rogue-95-talk-40381669